      "content": "Read-only REST API for accounting/bookkeeping practices to extract client data-health metrics and activity statistics from Dext. Authenticate with a bearer token created in Practice settings > Data Health > API tokens. Rate limited to 60 requests per minute.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dext Support",
